# Notes API — Manual Tests with VS Code REST Client extension or import into Postman

@base_url = http://localhost:8000


### Get all notes
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

### Create note 1 — expects 201 with the created note including id and createdAt
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "First Note",
  "content": "This is the content of my first note."
}

### Create note 2 — expects 201; GET afterwards should return note 2 first (newest-first sort)
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "Second Note",
  "content": "Another note to test the list view."
}


### Update heading only (PATCH) — expects 200; content must remain unchanged
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "Updated Heading"
}

###

### Update content only (PATCH) — expects 200; heading must remain unchanged
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated content body."
}

###

### Update both fields (PATCH) — expects 200 with both fields changed
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "New Heading",
  "content": "New content."
}

###

### Delete note 2 — expects 204 No Content
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/notes/1


# VALIDATION — POST /api/notes
# All of these expect 400 Bad Request with an "errors" array in the body.

### Missing heading — expects 400 with errors: ["heading must not be blank"]
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "No heading provided."
}

###

### Missing content — expects 400 with errors: ["content must not be blank"]
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "No content provided"
}

###

### Both fields missing — expects 400 with two entries in the errors array
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Blank heading (whitespace only) — expects 400; @NotBlank rejects whitespace-only strings
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "   ",
  "content": "Heading is just spaces."
}

###

### Blank content (whitespace only) — expects 400
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "Valid heading",
  "content": "   "
}

###

### Null heading explicitly — expects 400
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": null,
  "content": "Heading is null."
}

###

### Empty string heading — expects 400; empty string is also rejected by @NotBlank
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "",
  "content": "Heading is an empty string."
}


# NOT FOUND — PATCH and DELETE with non-existent ids
# All of these expect 404 Not Found.

### Update non-existent note — expects 404
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/notes/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "Ghost note"
}

###

### Delete non-existent note — expects 404
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/notes/999
